  "_comment": "Micro Event Engine catalog (Phase 2 -- Astrological Rule Library v1). Every event's identity and detection logic lives here, not in Python. house_in/house_not_in values are house numbers (1-12) relative to the natal Lagna. motion_equals is 'Direct'/'Retrograde'. sign_in values are classical own/exaltation signs. conjunction_with checks whether two transiting planets currently share a house. mahadasha_lord_in/antardasha_lord_in check the current dasha lord against a significator list. yoga_active checks one of calculate_full_kundali()'s own yoga evaluator results. natal_lord_house_in/natal_lord_aspected_by check the NATAL lord of a given house's own current transit house / natal aspects. priority is derived per detection run from confidence against priority_thresholds below -- it is never authored per event. Adding a new event, or a new rule on an existing event, requires editing this file only.",
